+- [#93](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/pull/93) [`a7faee0`](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/commit/a7faee013da49aa8415bad2da9f58be26e093fab) Thanks [@PazChen](https://github.com/PazChen)! - An agent refused for your plan, not your sign-in (Kimi: "403 Your current subscription does not have access to Kimi Code"), now shows its own words and stays signed in, instead of asking you to sign in again and again. A turn an agent ends without saying or doing anything (older Kimi, on a plan that does not cover it) is said so instead of left empty.
