+- [#93](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/pull/93) [`a7faee0`](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/commit/a7faee013da49aa8415bad2da9f58be26e093fab) Thanks [@PazChen](https://github.com/PazChen)! - Signing in to an agent in Terminal is waited for 15 minutes instead of 5, asking only that agent meanwhile, so a sign-in that takes a while on the maker's site is still noticed. Cursor is found when its installer named it `agent` only.
