+- [#93](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/pull/93) [`a7faee0`](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/commit/a7faee013da49aa8415bad2da9f58be26e093fab) Thanks [@PazChen](https://github.com/PazChen)! - Any tab can rename its project, not just the one in front: right-click it and choose Rename, or double-click it. A tab's name being edited now shows its selected words plainly.
